{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10133","headline":"南浦渡口 · 李嘉佑","name":"南浦渡口","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞横塘路，新篁覆水低。\n东风潮信满，时雨稻秔齐。\n寡妇共租税，渔人逐鼓鼙。\n慙无卓鲁术，解印谢黔黎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}